13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, yes! And I want to see how long a clean actually takes.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I think we should look at what ""done"" means. It changes every time.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, that is a good point. Inconsistency is the root of the problem.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will check the absences. It’s important to see who is actually here.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look at the chat history. I want to see where the conflict starts.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the spray receipts and the timing. I need to know the cost and time.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the grout and the definition of done. I need to know the standard.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will time a full pass. I need to know the true hour count.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,I will also look at the kitchen use. Who is actually cooking?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will check the previous tenants' note. I want to see what went wrong before.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
